      "message": "A connect/auth failure comes back as `[]` from `_discover_from_tables`, so this is also the path for a switch that could not be queried: the run prints \"No hosts discovered\", exits 0 and skips `--apply`. The plugin does log `Failed to connect to switch: ...` to stderr, but automation only sees the zero exit. A nonzero exit when the SSH query itself failed would separate it from an empty switch.",
