      "message": "Adding `--switch-ip` makes the pre-existing abbreviation `--switch` ambiguous with `--switch-config-applied` (argparse keeps `allow_abbrev` on by default). Verified: `--switch true` parses on the parent commit and now exits 2 with \"ambiguous option: --switch could match --switch-ip, --switch-config-applied\". Minor, but scripts using the abbreviation will break.",
